55709093827_7234041850784137373_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mdj-wISYiGQQ7kNvwHp9zXf&_nc_oc=Adrzk9noDBiMy3rB5dFX3ZiFmz2pEVVvc3HyDYTqZfsxtJmJ_F4kb0G-1ZGiNMUCaOk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQMOULnFH8XUDquzlg7B6O4xLK4OlXrhUkP1HEo1PFxew&oe=6B031292"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "JAS_PV_cover1.png", "id": "649181138258808", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618432_649181141592141_4738211282412047997_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZlQGixrUc2EQ7kNvwFAN8qy&_nc_oc=AdqwsvlbLx8SayoeBFutyaxjXusoPuLzom1TZ_JYaue8Fw4YjrOo9vPVubPp8CaesSs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTTYkpjiyjNcsRnat7rUdUuI5cav-Ep-0qDAvC0_yYEAQ&oe=6B0337FA"}, "display_name": "JAPAN ACTIVITY SIMULATOR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "There are over 28 different experiences based on the four paths of Bushido, Tea Ceremony, Flower Arrangement, and Calligraphy!\nAll activities are certified with ranks and titles!\n We have a wide variety of activities, from mindfulness activities like Samurai, Ninja, Tea Ceremony, Flower Arrangement, Kanji, Zazen, Hot Springs, and Sushi!\n We also have a wide variety of games and activities, from creative activities that express the soul to traditional Japanese games!\n{1119488606821638}\nRemove the tarnish from the sword and polish and align your mind as well\n{1184257777030409}\nEveryone is equal inside the tea room Regardless of rank, everyone should enter with their heads bowed\n{2944312539085173}\nArrange flowers of each season freely, and create whatever your heart desires, \nsuch as Chinese characters in ink paintings\n{1262677395914942}\nBeyond the 28+ activities, finding all the hidden \u201ckokeshi\u201ddolls will unlock a door to a new world", "short_description": "Experience the thrill of Japan\nUnder the moonlight, there is said to be a J